WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
With other gear
Send Polly's band to a computer, follow its clock, play from a keyboard and mirror the screen.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.360
1. Send MIDI out
Press GLO for Setup. KNOB 2 (MIDI out) is on. Turn it, and the screen says what it does.

3
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.360
1. Send MIDI out
Every instrument goes out over USB on its own channel, with the clock.

4
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.940
2. Follow MIDI clock
KNOB 1 (Clock) is on MIDI. Turn it, and the screen says what it does.

5
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.000
2. Follow MIDI clock
When clock comes in, Polly follows its tempo, start and stop.
